  "body": "# 0001. Keep authority outside the agent\n\n## Context and problem statement\n\nA governed change needs an accountable decision.\n\n## Considered options\n\n1. Let an automated actor approve its own work.\n2. Keep approval with an accountable role.\n\n## Decision outcome\n\nKeep approval with an accountable role.\n\n## Consequences\n\nAuthority remains visible and reviewable.",
